{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40850","headline":"游九鲤湖 · 郑良士","name":"游九鲤湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仄径倾崖不可通，湖岚林霭共溟蒙。\n九溪瀑影飞花外，万树春声细雨中。\n覆石云闲丹竈冷，采芝人去洞门空。\n我来不乞邯郸梦，取醉聊乘郑国风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑良士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}